  "body": "The MCP tool `set_stock_material` (#2015) shipped without its row in `.claude/skills/camcraft-mcp/SKILL.md`; the skill is a process file, so the row needs its own PR with a `.claude/PROCESS_VERSION` bump.\n\nFound while working #2015 (PR to follow on issue/2015-unknown-cutting-row).\n\nThe row: `set_stock_material { \"material\": string | null }` - state the active setup stock's workpiece material (same words as `set_work_material`), or null to clear. It picks each tool's cutting-data row for that setup's operations (stock, then document, then the tool's Unknown row) and re-seeds their feed (rows naming the material) and stepdown/stepover in one undo step. Also note `cutting_data` rows may now carry `\"material\": \"unknown\"` and optional `stepdown` / `stepover` (mm) in `add_tool` / `edit_tool` definitions.\n\nDone means: the skill lists `set_stock_material` and the new `cutting_data` keys, and `PROCESS_VERSION` is bumped.\n",
